WEBVTT

00:08:27.795 --> 00:08:31.507
the only place they could roam
without parents watching

00:08:31.549 --> 00:08:34.468
was in cyberspace with their cell phones.

00:08:35.636 --> 00:08:40.683
So is it any surprise
that teenagers love their cell phones?

00:08:41.517 --> 00:08:43.561
If you want to change behavior,

00:08:43.602 --> 00:08:47.022
you can't just look
at the phone, the noise,

00:08:47.064 --> 00:08:50.276
you have to look at the physical
experience, the silence too.

00:08:50.693 --> 00:08:54.863
And again, that's hard to see
if you just know one fishbowl.

00:08:56.115 --> 00:08:57.408
Another example.

00:08:57.408 --> 00:08:59.785
What is sitting at the end
of your noses right now

00:08:59.827 --> 00:09:02.204
or hopefully, called your face mask.